  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">G&#xe9;nesis: Microfinance Partnership Alliance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The loan proposed for Fundaci&#xf3;n Empresarial G&#xe9;nesis (&#x201c;G&#xe9;nesis&#x201d;) amounts to the Guatemalan quetzal (&#x201c;GTQ&#x201d;) equivalent of up to US$20 million, to support its productive microfinance portfolio in Guatemala. Fundaci&#xf3;n G&#xe9;nesis Empresarial is the largest microfinance institution in Guatemala. The term of the IDB Invest loan is expected to be five years. This loan will be complemented by a Technical Assistance from IDB Invest, aligning G&#xe9;nesis&#x2019; portfolio with the Sustainable Development Goals (&#x201c;SDG&#x201d;), improve funding capacities for sustainable finances, as well as establish a portfolio of microloans in climate change resilient agricultural productive chains.</narrative>
  </description>
